{"text": "It is not luck that you have good children, my friend.\n\nLuck does not wake in the middle of the night. Luck does not repeat the same lesson a hundred times. Luck does not choose patience when the body is tired and the mind is heavy. That was you.\n\nPeople look at your children and say you were fortunate. They did not see the mornings you got up with nothing left. They did not see what you swallowed so the house would stay calm.\n\nA child does not become gentle by accident. Someone was gentle with them first, on a day when it was not easy. So if nobody has said it to you, hear it now. It was not luck. It was you, choosing again and again when no one was watching.\n\nComment proud, and I will send you something to keep.\n\nBeing told once is warm. Believing it on the hard days is the work. Everything I know is inside The Quiet Between Thoughts. The link is in my profile.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "t", " ", "i", "s", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "l", "u", "c", "k", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "h", "a", "v", "e", " ", "g", "o", "o", "d", " ", "c", "h", "i", "l", "d", "r", "e", "n", ",", " ", "m", "y", " ", "f", "r", "i", "e", "n", "d", ".", "\n", "\n", "L", "u", "c", "k", " ", "d", "o", "e", "s", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "w", "a", "k", "e", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "m", "i", "d", "d", "l", "e", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "n", "i", "g", "h", "t", ".", " ", "L", "u", "c", "k", " ", "d", "o", "e", "s", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "r", "e", "p", "e", "a", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "a", "m", "e", " ", "l", "e", "s", "s", "o", "n", " ", "a", " ", "h", "u", "n", "d", "r", "e", "d", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "s", ".", " ", "L", "u", "c", "k", " ", "d", "o", "e", "s", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "c", "h", "o", "o", "s", "e", " ", "p", "a", "t", "i", "e", "n", "c", "e", " ", "w", "h", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "o", "d", "y", " ", "i", "s", " ", "t", "i", "r", "e", "d", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "